'''Dice Shard''' is a [[Cards and Runes#Other|consumable item]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]''.

== Effects ==
Upon use, it:
* rerolls all pedestal [[item]]s in the room (like {{i|The D6}})
* rerolls all [[pickups]] and [[trinket]]s in the room (like the {{i|D20}})

== Notes ==
* Despite it not being a card, the '''Dice Shard''' is considered a [[special card]], so it has a significantly lower chance of appearing compared to other cards.
* {{dlc|nr}} Similarly to runes, this item counts as a card and can be used with {{i|Blank Card}}.
* {{dlc+|r}} This item cannot be mimicked by either {{i|Blank Card}} or {{i|Clear Rune}}, and {{i|Tarot Cloth}} has no effect on it.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|a+}} '''Dice Shard''''s ID was changed from 44 to 49.
* {{dlc|r+}} '''Dice Shard''' can sometimes spawn within the special bedroom created by {{i|Lil Portal|n}}.

== Trivia ==
* The item's appearance is similar to {{i|The D6}}, but broken in half.
* {{dlc+|r}} Dice Shard is similar to {{P|Cracked Key}} in that they are both one-use broken versions of an active item. However, Dice Shard has an additional effect that The D6 lacks while Cracked Key simply replicates the use of Red Key.{{dlc-}}
* Despite being a dice item, Dice Shard is not an unlock.
** This trait is shared with {{I|D10}} and {{I|D7}}.

